<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN CUP SEMIFINAL POSTPONED BECAUSE OF FOG.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN CUP SEMIFINAL POSTPONED BECAUSE OF FOG.</headline>
<dateline>VICENZA, Italy 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first leg of the Italian Cup semifinal between Vicenza and Bologna was postponed on Thursday because of fog.</p>
<p>No new date was immediately set for the match.</p>
<p>In the other first leg semifinal, Internazionale and Napoli drew 1-1 on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
